    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/43c2a368b43c09704cc625773f9ad57a.poster.avif?t=1754426305\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/43c2a368b43c09704cc625773f9ad57a.webm?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/43c2a368b43c09704cc625773f9ad57a.mp4?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/9cde8bfca290e253fb6b1b95ba927e29.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home planet is on the edge of a dangerous galaxy, and your people rely on an ancient planetary defense system to survive. One day, the system starts to break down. Top engineers work to repair it, but a critical piece is missing. It is an ancient part that no one knows how to manufacture: <strong>the SPACE DINGUS</strong>. The only hope is to find a replacement\u2026 in SPACE.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/ab5b060ef01f0d0c1ef8494e8559add3.poster.avif?t=1754426305\" width=640 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/ab5b060ef01f0d0c1ef8494e8559add3.webm?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/ab5b060ef01f0d0c1ef8494e8559add3.mp4?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of your planet\u2019s bravest and brightest heroes were sent to find it, but all failed. Now you and your crew of friends, family, frenemies, and the occasional random jerk are everyone\u2019s last resort. You have <i>significant</i> budget restrictions. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/748b9aec2b4cbc7caf7deb5c94d86ad6.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Dingus is built for extreme replay value with mechanics for all play styles. Everything in-game is randomized too: Locations, events, loot, enemies, and more. There are many rare and special events that may surprise you, even after a hundred hours of playtime. It\u2019s a different story every time you play, set in a sci-fi horror universe that doesn't take itself too seriously.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart a path through a Star Map full of dangers and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your next missions based on your crew's strength and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge from a wide variety of locations, surviving through avoidance, skills such as hacking, using the environment to your advantage, or brute force.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/6a244c1360a14d65d7ebe515a508641c.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and customize a horrible spaceship that barely runs. Then remodel it until it\u2019s a less-horrible spaceship that runs! Build new rooms, upgrade your ship functions, and customize your personal quarters with all sorts of space junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/f0a4007ce59782b4ed8be56a339a1e40.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/d8d7be4454b23d9fe86e8fdf27c8a547.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the character creator to bring your friends, family, or people you know into the game. Meet them and other random drifters on your journey, recruit them aboard, and assign them crew roles. You can also choose their equipment, lead them on missions, swap between them, and send your least favorite to do the most dangerous tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/a97f295ead62a14607a23ac68aa2a559.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/0d173c94a27ebdff8f5df0377b8fa90a.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends at any time for up to 4-player online co-op, via a seamless drop-in, drop-out multiplayer system. Then act belligerent for no reason and get into petty debates via in-game chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/204031bb1d290fee5d04063cc73a54b0.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/16c41629a5e198c080561c0f8a07d624.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make tough moral, diplomatic, and tactical choices, then deal with the consequences. Every decision\u2019s outcome is also affected by the traits and personalities of your party members, and their assigned ship roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/b5c32ba64bfd1f038fd49950eed8f441.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/70cbece23deff0157566cd402df88451.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with all the horrors of space, including marauding factions, space crabs that pinch, ultra-rare enemies with special abilities, and giant swarms of all kinds\u2026 sometimes up to the hundreds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/4cd2296c2875578c2d52d4ee4e0b278d.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/1cf9f70e5e564fa13443cfabf40254ca.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Put an astronaut helmet on a dog. Give it mechanical arms on its back. Give it a rocket launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mod Support so you can replace all our hard work with your precious anime girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Character creation system where you can make anyone you like, and assign their skills, perks, appearance, and personality! (Use it to make your vtubers)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Throw chairs, in SPACE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Family friendly-ish. No swearing, but features cartoonish pixel gibs that spray everywhere as your family mows down hordes of Space Ants. This gore can be disabled in Options if your kids don't like <strong>SICK HEADSHOTS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Tell a primitive civilization that's never encountered space travelers to &quot;Cool it.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/43c2a368b43c09704cc625773f9ad57a.poster.avif?t=1754426305\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/43c2a368b43c09704cc625773f9ad57a.webm?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/43c2a368b43c09704cc625773f9ad57a.mp4?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/9cde8bfca290e253fb6b1b95ba927e29.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home planet is on the edge of a dangerous galaxy, and your people rely on an ancient planetary defense system to survive. One day, the system starts to break down. Top engineers work to repair it, but a critical piece is missing. It is an ancient part that no one knows how to manufacture: <strong>the SPACE DINGUS</strong>. The only hope is to find a replacement\u2026 in SPACE.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/ab5b060ef01f0d0c1ef8494e8559add3.poster.avif?t=1754426305\" width=640 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/ab5b060ef01f0d0c1ef8494e8559add3.webm?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/ab5b060ef01f0d0c1ef8494e8559add3.mp4?t=1754426305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of your planet\u2019s bravest and brightest heroes were sent to find it, but all failed. Now you and your crew of friends, family, frenemies, and the occasional random jerk are everyone\u2019s last resort. You have <i>significant</i> budget restrictions. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/748b9aec2b4cbc7caf7deb5c94d86ad6.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Dingus is built for extreme replay value with mechanics for all play styles. Everything in-game is randomized too: Locations, events, loot, enemies, and more. There are many rare and special events that may surprise you, even after a hundred hours of playtime. It\u2019s a different story every time you play, set in a sci-fi horror universe that doesn't take itself too seriously.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart a path through a Star Map full of dangers and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your next missions based on your crew's strength and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge from a wide variety of locations, surviving through avoidance, skills such as hacking, using the environment to your advantage, or brute force.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545200/extras/6a244c1360a14d65d7ebe515a508641c.avif?t=1754426305\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and customize a horrible spaceship that barely runs. Then remodel it until it\u2019s a less-horrible spaceship that runs! Build new rooms, upgrade your ship functions, and customize your personal quarters with all sorts of space junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img c