onality! (Use it to make your vtubers)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Throw chairs, in SPACE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Family friendly-ish. No swearing, but features cartoonish pixel gibs that spray everywhere as your family mows down hordes of Space Ants. This gore can be disabled in Options if your kids don't like <strong>SICK HEADSHOTS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Tell a primitive civilization that's never encountered space travelers to &quot;Cool it.&quot;</p>",
    "short_description": "Space Dingus is a co-op horror road trip, in SPACE! Manage your ship, lead a crew full of jerks, and explore a dangerous galaxy in a last-ditch effort to save your home. Every run is randomized, with new stories, characters, and events each time you play. From the team behind Death Road to Canada!",
